      "text": "### No Ribosomes, No Metabolism"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#007",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:virology:00-overview, git-history:virology:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "virology/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "virology/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:virology:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "virology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "virology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Virology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  LIVING CELL:                    VIRUS:\n  ──────────────                  ───────\n  Ribosomes: yes                  Ribosomes: no\n  ATP synthesis: yes              ATP synthesis: no\n  Self-replication: yes           Self-replication: no (needs host)\n  Cell division: yes              No cell division\n  Homeostasis: yes                No homeostasis\n  Response to environment: yes    Passive until inside host"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#008",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:virology:00-overview, git-history:virology:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "virology/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "virology/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:virology:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "virology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "virology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Virology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "→ Viruses are molecular parasites of cellular life, not a fourth domain\n  → They can only replicate by hijacking host ribosomes, energy, and\n    sometimes host DNA replication machinery\n```"
    },
