        "section": "virology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Virology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Smallest known: Circovirus (porcine) — 1.7 kb ssDNA, encodes 3 proteins.\nLargest known: Pandoravirus (~2.4 Mb dsDNA) — more protein-coding genes than\nsome bacteria."
    },
